Subject: [PATCH 01/10] vieww-3d: image-based lighting, HDRI, sky, skybox and
 dynamic probe GI; vieww-physics: 3D rigid bodies, joints, CCD, character
 controller, Voronoi fracture

Fifth gap pass (1/n). Environment maps (Radiance .hdr read/write, procedural
sky/studio/gradient), SH9 irradiance, GGX-prefiltered specular chain with
Karis' analytic environment BRDF, skybox and blurred backgrounds; a DDGI/
Lumen-style irradiance probe volume with dynamic round-robin updates and
dead-probe classification; the path tracer now samples the environment.

rigid3d: spheres, capsules, convex hulls (incremental hull with coplanar
merge, exact polyhedral mass properties), planes; GJK distance, SAT with
face clipping; sequential impulses with warm starting and friction;
ball (swing cone), hinge (limits, motor), fixed and distance joints; CCD,
sleeping, ray casts, contact events, character controller; Voronoi
fracture with impact-clustered seeds.

